menu "LED Task"

config LED_TASK_ENABLE
    bool "Enable LED task (board LEDs)"
    default n
    help
        Standalone four-channel LED driver. The LCKFB 立创实战派 ESP32-S3 board
        has no on-board LEDs (only the LCD backlight), so this is disabled by
        default. Enable it in menuconfig if your target board has LEDs.
        The code is kept in the tree and only linked when enabled.

endmenu
